## Proposed Repository Structure (Turborepo)

The project will be structured to separate concerns while maximizing code reuse.

### `apps/web/`
Next.js web dashboard for Sales, Marketing, and Admins. Includes the Unified Inbox, Broadcast composer, and No-Code Bot Studio.

### `apps/mobile/`
React Native (Expo) app for iOS and Android. Focuses on the mobile inbox, notifications, and SLA alerts.

### `apps/api/`
Node.js (Fastify/NestJS) main backend service. Handles authentication, workspace management, and database transactions.

### `apps/webhook-processor/`
Dedicated Node.js microservice to ingest Meta Webhooks, push them to Kafka, and process them asynchronously to ensure zero dropped messages.

### `apps/ai-service/`
Python (FastAPI) service dedicated to AI inferences, sentiment analysis, and generating reply suggestions.

### `packages/ui/`
Shared UI components (React/Tailwind) used by both Web and Mobile (where applicable).

### `packages/database/`
Prisma/Drizzle schema, migrations, and generated type-safe clients shared across backend services.

