## Phased Execution Strategy

### Phase 1: Foundation (Beta)
*Goal: Establish core messaging and infrastructure.*
- Set up Turborepo, CI/CD pipelines, and local Docker environments (Postgres, Redis, Kafka).
- Implement User Authentication, Multi-tenant Role-Based Access Control (RBAC).
- Integrate Meta Cloud API for sending/receiving WhatsApp messages.
- Build the Web App: Unified Team Inbox and basic Contact Management.
- Build the Core API and robust Webhook Processor.

### Phase 2: Intelligence & Automation (GA Launch)
*Goal: Introduce AI differentiators and Chatbot capabilities.*
- Stand up the Python AI Service.
- Implement AI Reply Suggestions and real-time Sentiment Analysis.
- Develop the Visual No-Code Bot Studio and WhatsApp Flows integration.
- Implement basic Campaign Broadcasting features.

### Phase 3: Scale & Analytics
*Goal: Enterprise features and massive scalability.*
- Deploy ClickHouse and build the Analytics & Reporting Dashboard.
- Build the multi-number management system (500+ numbers).
- Implement advanced routing rules, SLA monitoring, and Mobile Apps.
- Roll out CRM Integrations (Salesforce, HubSpot, Zoho).

### Phase 4: Revenue & Ecosystem
*Goal: Advanced marketing tools and attribution.*
- Develop the AI Ads Manager (Click-to-WhatsApp Ads).
- Build the Revenue Attribution Engine.
- Integrate E-commerce platforms (Shopify, WooCommerce) and Product Catalogs.

